#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:46
#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:137
msgid ""
"To prevent users from creating, editing, or deleting records, "
"untick :guilabel:`Can Create`, :guilabel:`Can Edit`, or :guilabel:`Can "
